From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:08:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 078/148] hjviewer: review fixes, tokens lane
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

U23: the peer card's screen reader label and the online dot's tooltip
took their state from translate('Online'/'Offline'), keys src/lang does
not have, so a Korean UI read the English word. They now come from
HjvTexts.online/offline (온라인/오프라인, Online/Offline).

U46: MyTheme.darkGray is a const for both themes; at #647080 its texts
in dark mode dropped below 4.5:1. The texts drawn in both themes (the
phone's service and audio tips, the phone's and desktop's file manager
lines, the desktop file manager's dark-only branches) use the palette's
textTertiary instead; darkGray keeps the light value for the remaining
icon and unused helper style. The check box's border and the switch's
off thumb are textDisabled when disabled. hjvHighContrast moves to
hjv_style.dart, which needs no bridge, makes each theme once instead of
on every build, and hjviewer_style_test covers its borders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
